    description: Some("Pengo the penguin skates a maze of ice blocks while Sno-Bees hunt him. Kick a block to send it sliding and squash them, or crush one trapped against a wall; kicking a wall makes the whole field vibrate and briefly freezes any Sno-Bee against it. Lining the three jewel blocks up so they touch scores the big bonus."),
